        <headline>Flood Advisory issued September 24 at 1:36PM CDT until September 24 at 1:45PM CDT by NWS Goodland KS</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 145 PM CDT /1245 PM MDT/ this
afternoon for portions of northwest and west central Kansas,
including the following areas, in northwest Kansas, Sheridan and
Thomas. In west central Kansas, Gove, Logan and Wallace.

The heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a
threat. Please continue to heed remaining road closures.
</description>
